Package: flourishR
Title: Tools for Reproducible Wellbeing and Survey Data Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Taylor G.",
        family = "Hill",
        email = "thill001@dundee.ac.uk",
				role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Tools for cross-national and longitudinal survey research with
    dedicated support for the Global Flourishing Study (GFS). Provides
    data preparation, documented missing-value recoding, country labels,
    personality scoring, survey design, retention analysis, country-specific
    regression, random-effects meta-analysis, longitudinal transformations,
    repeated-measures models and visualisation. Supports reproducible workflows
    using country-specific survey weights and unweighted mixed-effects models.
